67 1068 #edb/ref 17592186672460 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672467 1068 #edb/ref 17592186672474 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672467 1068 #edb/ref 17592186672482 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672467 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672467 1071 "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x+y+3z &=4 \\\\ x-\\frac{1}{2}y-\\frac{3}{2}z &=-5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672467 1072 #uuid "8af5dfcd-793c-58a3-ab83-cbf7376d71b5" 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672467 1074 "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & 1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} & -5\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & 1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{3}{2} & -5\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & 1 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nA row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y+0z=-3,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, select: The system is inconsistent." 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672468 1068 #edb/ref 17592186672447 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672468 1068 #edb/ref 17592186672449 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672468 1068 #edb/ref 17592186672459 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672468 1068 #edb/ref 17592186672480 13194139538691 17592186045443 true] [17592186672468 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139538691 17592186045443 tr